rl":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112450","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112450","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112450.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112450.patch","merged_at":"2025-11-21T20:52:42Z"},"body":"- Fix partially https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111938\r\n\r\nWhen a reset is triggered during a OneShot run, the shot port's animation should reset, but it was not doing so.\r\n\r\nThis PR change ensures that when a reset is triggered during a OneShot run, the shot port's animation will reset.\r\n\r\nIf a reset is triggered during a fade-out, the in port's animation will reset and play again after the abort.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/873a62b5-1302-4090-9b50-5dc7e8ed9f9f\r\n\r\nBTW, abort is performed when reset is triggered during fadeout is the same as before. As I explained somewhere earlier, this is because the internal state is already in the next state (running \"in\" port's animation) when fadeout starts.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nThis issue has existed since the beginning of 4.0. I consider this a bug, but since it involves a bit of behavior change, I added a break compat label.\r\n\r\nTo preserve the previous behavior where it wouldn't reset during reset, you must explicitly avoid triggering reset. AnimationNodes that could trigger a reset should have this setting, so you can disable it.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"577\" height=\"338\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f88f7cd6-010f-45f9-a845-39a96f37fc35\" />\r\n\r\n<img width=\"572\" height=\"194\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94b72bd7-56e8-4092-a73b-7bd2c99d881b\" />\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112450/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/112450/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}